  <revision rev="3" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>5acfb887d60156ce7fe43a56eca15ef7</srcmd5>
    <version>2.69.0</version>
    <time>1787656805</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 2.69.0.

Upstream change: the generation-tracking analytics events are reported
under event_type instead of event, so the started and completed events
match the current telemetry schema. That is the only difference in the
published bundle between 2.68.1 and 2.69.0.

The vendored runtime dependency set was regenerated for the new release
with the node_modules service; picomatch 4.0.5 -&gt; 4.0.7 is the only
change, the set is otherwise identical (71 tarballs, same licences).

Built and verified on openSUSE_Tumbleweed/aarch64: rpmlint 0 errors,
0 badness, the one warning (obsolete-not-provided gen-ai) is the
deliberate one documented in the spec.</comment>
